---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for Creator Growth Tools.">
  <section class="page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Creator Growth Tools is a static editorial site. The MVP does not collect account registrations, payment details, or user-submitted personal data.</p>
      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>The planned analytics setup is Cloudflare Web Analytics for page views, referral sources, and landing pages, Pinterest Analytics for pin performance, and affiliate network dashboards for outbound affiliate performance. No heavy analytics library is required for the MVP.</p>
      <h2>Outbound links</h2>
      <p>When you click links to third-party SaaS websites, those companies may process information according to their own privacy policies.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>This MVP does not yet publish a public contact form. Add a contact method before broader distribution.</p>
      <p>Last updated: 2026-08-21.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
